    "The Prophet ﷺ said: “Backbiting is worse than adultery.” He was asked how, and said: “The adulterer repents and God accepts his repentance; but the backbiter is not forgiven until the one he backbit forgives him.” (al-Saduq, Iqab al-A'mal, Bab 'iqab al-Ghibah; Bihar al-Anwar, vol. 72, Bab al-Ghibah)",
    "Imam Ali (a.s.) said: “Backbiting is the tool of the incapable.” (Nahj al-Balagha, al-Hikam, Saying 461)"
