    "Imam Ja'far al-Sadiq (a.s.) said: “Supplication (dua) is the weapon of the believer, the pillar of religion, and the light of the heavens and the earth.” (al-Kafi, vol. 2, Kitab al-Du'a, Bab anna al-Du'a silah al-mu'min)",
