    "Imam Ja'far al-Sadiq (a.s.) said: “Command your children with the prayer when they reach seven years.” (al-Saduq, Man la yahduruhu al-Faqih, vol. 1, Bab wujub al-Salah; Wasa'il al-Shia, Kitab al-Salah)",
    "It is related from Imam Ali (a.s.): “Do not compel your children to your own ways, for they are created for a time other than your time.” (attributed to Imam Ali; Bihar al-Anwar, vol. 101, Kitab al-'Ishrah)"
